This is an attempt to address the outstanding issues in https://github.com/cypress-io/cypress/pull/17738#issuecomment-902049761, a PR to address https://cypress-io.atlassian.net/browse/UNIFY-278

### General changes
- [x] Rename the `DevServerOptions` type to `DevServerConfig`
- [x] Rename all dev server functions to `devServer`
- [x] Rename the first `devServer` argument (new signature) to `cypressDevServerConfig`
- [x] Rename the second `devServer` argument (new signature) to `devServerConfig`
- [x] Rename all dev server `devServerConfig` types to follow the pattern `Cypress___DevServerConfig` eg. `CypressBabelDevServerConfig`
- [x] Update each react dev server module to support both the current (legacy) signature as the default export _and_ the new signature as a `devServer` named export
- [x] Update types in each react dev server module `index.d.ts` to support the default + named exports
- [x] Export the type for all dev server `devServerConfig`
- [x] Export a `defineDevServerConfig` helper function in each dev server

### Module-specific changes
- [x] Update the named export CRACO dev server signature second argument to be an object like `{ cracoConfig }`


### APIs that this PR intends to create

#### Babel

Legacy (plugins/index.js)
```js
const setupBabelDevServer = require('@cypress/react/plugins/babel')
module.exports = (on, config) => {
  setupBabelDevServer(on, config)
  return config
}
```

